      "updated_at": "2026-06-30T05:31:37Z",
      "body": "Also does `--foo TEXT...` means multiple `TEXT` values like `--foo TEXT1 TEXT2 TEXT3` or multiples `--foo` options like `--foo TEXT1 --foo TEXT2 --foo TEXT3`? 😏 So yeah, this looks like a rabbit hole I will not dive into. Not yet at least until we start thinking about the shape the customizable formatter should look like.",
